{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 3, "text": "在天上。", "bbox_px": {"x": 470, "y": 330, "w": 157, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "在天上。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 470, "y": 330, "w": 157, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 4, "text": "恩德播四方，", "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 392, "w": 230, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "恩德播四方，", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 392, "w": 230, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 5, "text": "恩德撒四面。", "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 456, "w": 234, "h": 62}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "恩德撒四面。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 456, "w": 234, "h": 62}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 6, "text": "这就把地上的国王“兴”同时说成是天上的神，“兴”主宰人间的各种事情。", "bbox_px": {"x": 229, "y": 519, "w": 1291, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "这就把地上的国王“兴”同时说成是天上的神，“兴”主宰人间的各种事情。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 229, "y": 519, "w": 1291, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 7, "text": "春天，“兴”来主播种，", "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 583, "w": 382, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "春天，“兴”来主播种，", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 583, "w": 382, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 8, "text": "“兴”在上层主收获。", "bbox_px": {"x": 465, "y": 644, "w": 376, "h": 65}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "“兴”在上层主收获。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 465, "y": 644, "w": 376, "h": 65}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 9, "text": "请示您啊造木碓，", "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 715, "w": 314, "h": 59}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "请示您啊造木碓，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 715, "w": 314, "h": 59}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 10, "text": "请示您啊修石坎。", "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 778, "w": 314, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "请示您啊修石坎。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 778, "w": 314, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 11, "text": "一切都属“兴”所有，人们获得的东西，不是由“兴”王所赐，就是向“兴”王赎买而来：", "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 841, "w": 1463, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "一切都属“兴”所有，人们获得的东西，不是由“兴”王所赐，就是向“兴”王赎买而来：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 225, "y": 841, "w": 1463, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 12, "text": "王啊，您分下的粮食给我吃，", "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 909, "w": 499, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "王啊，您分下的粮食给我吃，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 909, "w": 499, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 13, "text": "您留下稻种我赎买。", "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 982, "w": 354, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "您留下稻种我赎买。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 982, "w": 354, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 14, "text": "我要赎到十一、十二层天里，", "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 1046, "w": 494, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "我要赎到十一、十二层天里，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 1046, "w": 494, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 15, "text": "赎到四面八方的地面。", "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 1110, "w": 394, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "赎到四面八方的地面。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 1110, "w": 394, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 16, "text": "赎来谷子奶样白，", "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 1175, "w": 310, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "赎来谷子奶样白，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 1175, "w": 310, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 17, "text": "赎来田地和种子，", "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 1239, "w": 310, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "赎来田地和种子，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 1239, "w": 310, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 18, "text": "赎来豆种和养麦。", "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 1304, "w": 314, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "赎来豆种和养麦。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 1304, "w": 314, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 19, "text": "这种王有无上权力，以及王权神权统一的思想，在原始意识的阶段是没有的。因此，", "bbox_px": {"x": 229, "y": 1368, "w": 1467, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "这种王有无上权力，以及王权神权统一的思想，在原始意识的阶段是没有的。因此，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 229, "y": 1368, "w": 1467, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 20, "text": "布依族王权神授思想是奴隶制社会的产物，是继承传统儒家“君权神授”思想的结果。", "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 1424, "w": 1483, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族王权神授思想是奴隶制社会的产物，是继承传统儒家“君权神授”思想的结果。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 1424, "w": 1483, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 21, "text": "在《柔番沃番钱》中还提出了“上天”为最高主宰神的观念和“灾难的墨线”的概念。", "bbox_px": {"x": 229, "y": 1493, "w": 1467, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "在《柔番沃番钱》中还提出了“上天”为最高主宰神的观念和“灾难的墨线”的概念。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 229, "y": 1493, "w": 1467, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 22, "text": "史诗认为，王虽然有极大的权力，但是王还要受“上天”的支配。“上天”震怒时，就会按他", "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 1557, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "史诗认为，王虽然有极大的权力，但是王还要受“上天”的支配。“上天”震怒时，就会按他", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 1557, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 23, "text": "的原则—“灾难的墨线”来惩罚王。那么，上天什么会震怒呢？其实，上天之所以震", "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 1621, "w": 1540, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "的原则—“灾难的墨线”来惩罚王。那么，上天什么会震怒呢？其实，上天之所以震", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 1621, "w": 1540, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 24, "text": "怒，乃在于人民对统治者的不满。这与西周、春秋时期，汉民族“以德配天”的思想是一致", "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 1686, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "怒，乃在于人民对统治者的不满。这与西周、春秋时期，汉民族“以德配天”的思想是一致", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 1686, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 25, "text": "的。同董仲舒的“谴告”说也极相似，反映了古代布依族人民的思想水平已达到了相当", "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 1750, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "的。同董仲舒的“谴告”说也极相似，反映了古代布依族人民的思想水平已达到了相当", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 1750, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 26, "text": "高的水平。史诗记载说，当为民除害的英雄“真”被“揉”王所欺骗时：", "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 1810, "w": 1206, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "高的水平。史诗记载说，当为民除害的英雄“真”被“揉”王所欺骗时：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 1810, "w": 1206, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 27, "text": "愤怒的“真”啊，", "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 1879, "w": 277, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "愤怒的“真”啊，", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 1879, "w": 277, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 28, "text": "等着灾难的墨线再出现。", "bbox_px": {"x": 478, "y": 1947, "w": 434, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "等着灾难的墨线再出现。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 478, "y": 1947, "w": 434, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 29, "text": "愤怒的“真”啊，", "bbox_px": {"x": 478, "y": 2007, "w": 274, "h": 54}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "愤怒的“真”啊，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 478, "y": 2007, "w": 274, "h": 54}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 30, "text": "把脸朝向神圣的铜鼓。①", "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 2063, "w": 427, "h": 62}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "把脸朝向神圣的铜鼓。①", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 474, "y": 2063, "w": 427, "h": 62}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 31, "text": "结果，“上天看见了”，就向王“揉”的国家降下了巨大的灾难。这种至上神的观念和", "bbox_px": {"x": 233, "y": 2132, "w": 1467, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "结果，“上天看见了”，就向王“揉”的国家降下了巨大的灾难。这种至上神的观念和", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 233, "y": 2132, "w": 1467, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 32, "text": "天命观念，是随着布依族奴隶制的统一政权——夜郎国的出现之后才产生的，同时，它也", "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 2201, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "天命观念，是随着布依族奴隶制的统一政权——夜郎国的出现之后才产生的，同时，它也", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 2201, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 33, "text": "表明了布依族先民抽象思维水平的提高。", "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 2265, "w": 724, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "表明了布依族先民抽象思维水平的提高。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 2265, "w": 724, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 34, "text": "二、布依族民歌中的反封建思想", "bbox_px": {"x": 233, "y": 2329, "w": 555, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "二、布依族民歌中的反封建思想", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 233, "y": 2329, "w": 555, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 35, "text": "民间歌谣的萌发，是人类历史上第一次不自觉的艺术创作，它起源于劳动的呼声。", "bbox_px": {"x": 237, "y": 2394, "w": 1467, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "民间歌谣的萌发，是人类历史上第一次不自觉的艺术创作，它起源于劳动的呼声。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 237, "y": 2394, "w": 1467, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 123, "line_no": 36, "text": "① 布依族认为铜鼓是神圣的器物，可以通神。", "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 2539, "w": 708, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "① 布依族认为铜鼓是神圣的器物，可以通神。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 2539, "w": 708, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
